OL,3,GNEWSAAgatha Christie themed twinning
OL,4,Aagreement signed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo locations with links to crime
OL,7,Fwriter Agatha Christie and one of her
OL,8,Ffamous detectives have been twinned.
OL,10,FA ceremony held at Torre Abbey in
OL,11,FTorquay, Devon, marked the occasion as
OL,12,FTorbay and the Belgian town of Spa
OL,13,Fsigned a twinning agreement.
OL,15,FChristie, who is recognised as the best
OL,16,Fselling novelist of all time, was born
OL,17,Fin Torquay and lived in Torbay while
OL,18,Fthe character of Hercule Poirot - the
OL,19,Fstar of dozens of her stories - was
OL,20,Fborn in Spa.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
