OL,3,GNEWSAAgatha Christie themed twinning
OL,4,Aagreement signed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHazel Foster, Torbay's civic mayor,
OL,7,Fsaid the twinning was about friendship
OL,8,Fand uniting places together.
